OL,3,CFormer England star Andy Carroll
OL,4,Creveals he was victim of a sexual
OL,5,Cassault
OL,7,FFormer England footballer Andy Carroll
OL,8,Fhas revealed he was sexually assaulted
OL,9,Fby a male celebrity in 2021. His
OL,10,Fbravery in writing about what happened
OL,11,Fhas been praised by campaign groups,
OL,12,FITV News Correspondent Geraint Vincent
OL,13,Freports
OL,15,FFormer England forward Andy Carroll
OL,16,Fhas revealed in his new autobiography
OL,17,Fthat he was sexually assaulted by a
OL,18,Fman in 2021.
