OL,3,CFormer England star Andy Carroll
OL,4,Creveals he was victim of a sexual
OL,5,Cassault
OL,7,FThe 37-year-old, who played for
OL,8,FNewcastle and Liverpool, included the
OL,9,Fdetails in his new book, titled
OL,10,F'Owning it', and said that if "talking
OL,11,Fabout it helps just one person", then
OL,12,Fit "will have been worth it".
OL,14,FAs a victim of sexual assault, Carroll
OL,15,Fwas automatically granted anonymity
OL,16,Funder UK law, before deciding himself
OL,17,Fto share his story.
