OL,3,CFormer England star Andy Carroll
OL,4,Creveals he was victim of a sexual
OL,5,Cassault
OL,7,FCarroll revealed the incident took
OL,8,Fplace at his home during a second
OL,9,Fspell at Newcastle. The offender ` a
OL,10,Ffriend of his former partner, who was
OL,11,Fstaying away at the time ` was later
OL,12,Fjailed for three years, with Carroll
OL,13,Fhaving testified in court.
OL,15,FFormer Liverpool and West Ham striker
OL,16,FCarroll, who is now a player/co-owner
OL,17,Fof National League South club Dagenham
OL,18,F& Redbridge, said the incident
OL,19,Fhappened when he was sleeping.
