OL,3,CFormer England star Andy Carroll
OL,4,Creveals he was victim of a sexual
OL,5,Cassault
OL,7,FHe then threw the man out of the
OL,8,Fhouse, and knocked him unconscious
OL,9,Fwhen he attempted to get back inside.
OL,11,F"I was sexually assaulted, there I
OL,12,Fsaid it. Scary to even think about and
OL,13,Fonly a few people knew about it before
OL,14,Fnow," wrote Carroll, who had decided
OL,15,Fto include the incident in his book
OL,16,F"at the very last minute" after
OL,17,Fdiscussing it with his girlfriend, Lou
OL,18,FTeasdale.
