OL,7,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,F"Me and Lou spent a lot of time
OL,13,Fdiscussing whether to mention it in
OL,14,Fthis book or not. I avoided my
OL,15,Fpublisher for so long that they
OL,16,Fprobably suspected I got cold feet.
