OL,3,CFormer England star Andy Carroll
OL,4,Creveals he was victim of a sexual
OL,5,Cassault
OL,7,F"Scary to talk about but it's made
OL,8,F(me) the person I am today as much as
OL,9,Fany of the good stuff. And if me
OL,10,Ftalking about it helps just one person
OL,11,Fthen good, it will have been worth it."
OL,13,FCarroll said testifying in court was
OL,14,F"humiliating and embarrassing and
OL,15,Fabsolutely horrendous".
