OL,3,CFormer England star Andy Carroll
OL,4,Creveals he was victim of a sexual
OL,5,Cassault
OL,7,F"What happened to me affected every
OL,8,Ffacet of my life," he said. "I'd think
OL,9,Fabout it every day, making it
OL,10,Fdifficult to focus on anything else,
OL,11,Fincluding football... The trauma of
OL,12,Fwhat happened to me hasn't gone away."
